  "title": "Aunt Bert&#39;s Fruitcake Cookies",
  "description": "Like bite-size rich fruitcakes, this big batch of Christmas cookies is loaded with bourbon-soaked dried fruit, candied fruit, and pecans.",
  "authors": [
    "the4taals"
  ],
